<title>UK: World Bank sets 1.0 bln dem 20-yr zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 1.0 bln dem 20-yr zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    08.NOV.16</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  27.73     PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    27.53     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND 2016</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
